This license covers the CODE in this repository.

The model weights distributed via GitHub Releases are a separate matter. They
were trained on `HuggingFaceCode/stack-v3-train` filtered to files dated
2024-01-01 or later. That corpus contains files whose license was detected as
`permissive` and files where no license was detected (`no_license`);
`non_permissive` files are excluded upstream by the dataset authors. The
dataset itself ships under ODC-BY.

`no_license` means no license was detected -- not that the code is public
domain. The weights are published as-is, with no claim of ownership over
anything derived from that corpus and no warranty. If that provenance matters
for your use, do your own diligence.
